{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">網上近日流傳一段影片，荃灣海濱長廊單車徑發生一宗因路權引發的衝突。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-04-11h01m37s652.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026wO1EBTdN3F1788493220.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-04-11h01m37s652.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">事發於本月2日晚上7時35分，一名阿伯騎單車沿荃灣海濱長廊單車徑行駛期間，遇上一對正在跑步的夫婦，分別為33歲男子及31歲女子。阿伯向二人響咹提醒，並在緊急煞停閃避時險些跌倒，雙方因而起爭執對罵。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-04-11h01m45s879.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026NnWMXWEGY31788493226.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-04-11h01m45s879.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">衝突期間，灰衫男子突情緒失控，出腳將阿伯的單車踢翻在地。阿伯不甘示弱，即時上前抓緊灰衫男的衣領，兩人爆發肢體拉扯。同行女子見狀大喊「打999」，阿伯亦高聲怒吼：「你踢我單車，打999！」灰衫男隨後轉身拔腿逃跑，阿伯追趕數步後停下大聲斥責。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-04-11h01m52s886.png\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026Ex6wfNqXxD1788493234.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-09-04-11h01m52s886.png\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">警方證實接獲相關報案，警員到場時發現雙方已經平靜，案件最終列作「糾紛」跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-04T04:20:25.717514+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":291,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}